<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Implementation Details</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Configuration for our model, and the variants used in ablation studies are shown in Table  <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Speak, Edit, Repeat: High-Fidelity Voice Editing and Zero-Shot TTS with Cross-Attentive Mamba" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. All models were trained under consistent experimental settings, using Scaled Adam optimizer and Eden Secheduler proposed in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">46</a>]</cite>, with a base learning rate of 0.01. Hyperparameters were carefully selected to ensure a fair comparison, with all models constrained to have approximately 830 million parameters.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Model architecture details for different configurations.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
